nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI明确表态支持特朗普AI行政令，将接受模型发布前政府安全评估</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cloudflare CEO确认机器人流量占比超57%，互联网将全面走向付费抓取时代</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布递归自我改进警告，呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发步伐</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯文档发布「人机双写」功能并原生接入WorkBuddy构建AI原生编辑器</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/253447d8854f4e6178ea27ff659528a2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月5日，腾讯文档在2026腾讯云AI产业应用大会上发布行业首创的「人机双写」能力，正式进化为AI原生编辑器。该功能依托WorkBuddy统一Agent内核，通过自研高性能编辑引擎与专业Skill，实现AI以同事身份进入编辑器，与用户实时同屏协作。AI可执行文字填充、数据清洗、图表生成及PPT美化，并支持自动解决双重编辑冲突及操作逐条回溯。目前，腾讯文档企业版已全品类AI化，作为「效率智能体套件」核心组件深度内嵌至WorkBuddy工作台。通过OneID体系与腾讯网盘，腾讯文档将实现资产互通，并依托腾讯混元大模型算力，通过MCP协议与OpenAPI开放百余项接口。此次升级标志着编辑范式从对话式AI向执行式AI演进，实现了模型与产品的Co-Design。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国 269 页AI立法草案出炉：巨头面临“半年一审”，各州监管权被“冻结”三年</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97cf32890bed12ea8b3a96c0d7d593b6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国 269 页AI立法草案出炉：巨头面临“半年一审”，各州监管权被“冻结”三年AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 5, 20261216 月 5 日，美国众议院两党议员联合公布了一份长达 269 页的人工智能立法讨论稿，试图将前沿AI模型的安全审计、员工举报保护以及AI就业影响研究全面纳入联邦框架。这份名为《伟大美国人工智能法案（Great American Artificial Intelligence Act of 2026）》的草案由加州共和党众议员杰伊·奥伯诺特和马萨诸塞州民主党众议员洛丽·特拉汉牵头，目前仍处于征求反馈阶段，尚未正式提交表决。这份草案最引人注目的焦点，在于对“大型前沿开发商”的严格约束。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI明确表态支持特朗普AI行政令，将接受模型发布前政府安全评估</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI负责各国事务的负责人乔治·奥斯本在伦敦SXSW活动期间证实，公司将签署并遵守特朗普政府签署的人工智能模型发布前审查行政命令。根据该行政命令，联邦政府可在模型正式发布前30天获取访问权限，并要求企业参与基准测试，以评估模型在网络能力等方面的先进程度，从而界定是否属于“受监管的前沿模型”。奥斯本表示，OpenAI对自身责任态度严肃，不会被动等待监管，并正主动向各国政府建议建立“强有力但具备高度灵活性”的监管机构，以适应技术快速演进。此举标志着OpenAI在面对美国联邦政府强化审查压力时，选择以主动合作姿态回应，旨在平衡前沿AI创新与国家安全监管要求，为大模型能力设定最低监管门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cloudflare CEO确认机器人流量占比超57%，互联网将全面走向付费抓取时代</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e36765e1131c7c20912db2cc8090cc2a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cloudflare首席执行官马修·普林斯宣布，互联网流量格局发生历史性逆转，机器人、爬虫及AI智能体产生的自动访问流量已达全球总量的57.4%，正式超越人类用户流量。这一趋势较原定2027年的预测提前爆发，主要受各类AI智能体高频访问驱动。普林斯指出，互联网生态正面临颠覆，未来将全面走向“付费抓取”模式。为应对这一变革，Cloudflare正全力开发全新的底层基础设施与协议，旨在支持未来高频结算与流量控制需求。公司此前已推出允许网站所有者拦截AI爬虫并对数据抓取收费的服务平台，未来将进一步推动网站所有者将自动化流量转化为商业变现机遇。随着谷歌AI概述等功能普及，用户获取信息方式正从传统网页浏览向AI总结转变，行业需从对抗思维转向构建全新的数据价值交换生态。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布递归自我改进警告，呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发步伐</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cad2a27af8601fe2ccee7556f592387.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于6月4日发布《当AI构建自身》文章，披露AI在代码编写与自我改进方面的进展，并呼吁全球放缓前沿AI研发。数据显示，截至2026年5月，Anthropic代码库中超80%代码由Claude自主编写，工程师代码交付量较2024年同期增长8倍。在模型训练优化测试中，Claude加速能力已达52倍，故障修复效率远超人类。Anthropic警告，“递归自我改进”时代正加速逼近，若AI实现全面自建下一代系统，微小的“不对齐”行为可能被复利放大，导致人类失去控制权。公司建议建立全球协调机制，在必要时主动放缓或暂停研发，以留出对齐研究的调适时间。尽管Anthropic已启动IPO筹备，年化收入突破470亿美元，但此次公开表态折射出前沿科技在商业扩张与技术失控风险之间的深刻悖论。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
